{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725","id":3155494890,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc68FQfq","number":12725,"title":"Ghost Files reported in #problems attached to the chat","user":{"login":"MarioRicalde","id":125900,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTkwMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioRicalde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRicalde/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-06-18T05:12:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:34:20Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:34:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Under certain circumstances files created by the agent will remain \"loaded\" even if they are deleted from disk. This will cause the \"Problems\" tab to highlight errors for that file, even if it does not exist.\n\nThis causes the AI to hallucinate and begin to trying to remove the file. And it \"loops\" creating a bunch of files in the process, which then sometimes fails to delete.\n\nI know these files are tied to the chat, because if I start a new chat and restart VSCode the errors will go away. If I load the chat conversation again, the files reappear.\n\n- Copilot Chat Extension Version: github.copilot-chat@0.29.2025061801\n- VS Code Version: 1.102.0-insider\n- OS Version: Windows 11\n- Feature (e.g. agent/edit/ask mode): agent\n- Selected model (e.g. GPT 4.1, Claude 3.7 Sonnet): Claude 4 (Preview)\n- Logs:\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Have the agent create a file until it says \"the file got corrupted, I better delete it and try again\".\n","closed_by":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/events{/privacy}","received_events_u