20:47Z","body":"> I'm facing a similar issue almost every day the past weeks. It seems to me sort of a cache issue.\n> \n> Files deleted manually or by the agent reappears from time to time after agent execution.\n> \n> Sometimes the typescript server keeps showing errors of deleted files; restarting the typescript server does not solve the problem\n> \n> Sometimes the files are recreated empty in the filesystem after additional agent execution.\n> \n> * both vscode insiders and latest stable releases;\n> * OS running vscode: windows 10 with remote ssh on a ubuntu 25.04\n\nSame issue here, when the agent creates a file and I undo it or delete the file manually, they often reappear on the next vscode session but empty. They also appear on the filesystem so vscode must be creating them again for some reason.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3150394979/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3648058434","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725#issuecomment-3648058434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/12725","id":3648058434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7ZcPRC","user":{"login":"bhavyaus","id":25044782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ0Nzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25044782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus","html_url":"https://github.com/bhavyaus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhavyaus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub